IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. FEE0047.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    COPY FEE0047C.
01 WS-OUT-REC.
    05 OVERLIMIT-FEE      PIC 9(5)V99 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
A000-MAIN.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM EXCESS-TXN-FEE
    PERFORM BUSINESS-SURCHARGE
    DISPLAY "OVERLIMIT-FEE=" OVERLIMIT-FEE
    STOP RUN.
EXCESS-TXN-FEE.
    *>  OLD CHECK REMOVED 2004
    *>  IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 12
    *>      PERFORM 9000-OLD-HANDLING
    *>  END-IF
    IF MONTHLY-TXNS > 15
        COMPUTE OVERLIMIT-FEE = (MONTHLY-TXNS - 15) * 0.75
    END-IF.
BUSINESS-SURCHARGE.
    *> BUSINESS HIGH-VOLUME SURCHARGE
    IF ACCT-TYP = 'B' AND MONTHLY-TXNS > 45
        ADD 15 TO OVERLIMIT-FEE
    END-IF.
